<title>MALAYSIA: Land &amp; General 1996 net up 60 pct.</title>
<headline>Land &amp; General 1996 net up 60 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Dec. 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     182.44	 vs	  113.81</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	37.6	 vs	   25.9</p>
<p>    Turnover		 837.14	 vs	 811.12</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 241.99	 vs	 192.39</p>
<p>    Minorities  less	22.32	 vs   less  8.38</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)	15.0	  vs	  20.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Land &amp; General Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
